{"id": "smoke-enables-network", "file": ".github/workflows/container-smoke.yml", "old": "docker run --rm --network none diwan:ci diwan check --json", "new": "docker run --rm diwan:ci diwan check --json", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_the_smoke_runs_offline_and_expects_the_declared_exit"], "why": "The offline acceptance must not reach a host model."}
{"id": "container-loses-state-volume", "file": "Dockerfile", "old": "VOLUME [\"/app/var\"]", "new": "# VOLUME removed", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_container_state_is_a_volume_and_desktop_does_not_require_host_networking"], "why": "The runtime state must survive replacing the image."}
{"id": "ci-omits-replacement-read", "file": ".github/workflows/container-smoke.yml", "old": "ci/container_state.py read", "new": "ci/container_state.py write", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_ci_always_runs_python_tests_and_checks_replacement_and_tool_install"], "why": "Writing twice cannot prove that state survived replacement."}
{"id": "docker-context-includes-owner-corpus", "file": ".dockerignore", "old": "\ncorpus/\n", "new": "\n# corpus exclusion removed\n", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_restored_private_stores_are_excluded_from_the_build_context"], "why": "Restored private corpus must stay outside Docker context."}
{"id": "ui-offline-expects-engine-ready", "file": ".github/workflows/container-smoke.yml", "old": "\"ui\": (\"ok\", \"ui_ready_without_engine\")}", "new": "\"ui\": (\"ok\", \"ui_ready\")}", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_the_offline_smoke_expects_the_ui_step_without_an_engine"], "why": "الحاويةُ بلا شبكة تنتظر واجهةً جاهزةً بمحرّكٍ غائب فيسقط الفحصُ على عطبٍ لا وجود له"}
{"id": "ui-offline-code-unknown", "file": ".github/workflows/container-smoke.yml", "old": "\"ui\": (\"ok\", \"ui_ready_without_engine\")}", "new": "\"ui\": (\"ok\", \"ui_waiting\")}", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_the_offline_smoke_expects_the_ui_step_without_an_engine", "tests/test_container_image.py::test_the_expected_steps_are_the_ones_launch_check_emits"], "why": "رمزٌ منتظَر لا يُخرجه launch_check"}
{"id": "wrangler-secrets-enter-image", "file": ".dockerignore", "old": "**/.dev.vars\n", "new": "# .dev.vars\n", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_local_worker_secrets_and_build_artifacts_are_excluded_from_the_build_context"], "why": "A local wrangler secrets file in the checkout is copied into an image layer."}
{"id": "image-uv-version-floats", "file": "Dockerfile", "old": "RUN printf '%s\\n' 'uv==0.8.17 \\", "new": "RUN printf '%s\\n' 'uv \\", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_the_image_installs_from_the_frozen_lock_with_a_pinned_uv"], "why": "uv يُثبَّت بلا إصدارٍ محدّد فتتغيّر أداةُ الحلّ بين بناءين (#285)"}
{"id": "runtime-stage-installs-the-dev-extra", "file": "Dockerfile", "old": "FROM base\nRUN uv sync --frozen --no-install-project --python /usr/local/bin/python3\n", "new": "FROM base\nRUN uv sync --frozen --no-install-project --extra dev --python /usr/local/bin/python3\n", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_the_runtime_image_never_receives_the_dev_extra"], "why": "صورةُ التشغيل تحمل hatchling وpytest من الإضافة dev، وهما لبناء العجلة واختبارات CI وحدهما (#285)"}
{"id": "runtime-stage-inherits-the-wheel-stage", "file": "Dockerfile", "old": "FROM base\nRUN uv sync --frozen --no-install-project --python /usr/local/bin/python3\n", "new": "FROM wheel\nRUN uv sync --frozen --no-install-project --python /usr/local/bin/python3\n", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_the_runtime_image_never_receives_the_dev_extra"], "why": "صورةُ التشغيل تبدأ من مرحلة العجلة فترث طبقةَ dev وإن أخفتها المزامنةُ بعدها (ملاحظة Codex على #294)"}
{"id": "runtime-stage-builds-the-wheel-itself", "file": "Dockerfile", "old": "COPY --from=wheel /opt/diwan-wheel /opt/diwan-wheel\n", "new": "RUN uv sync --frozen --no-install-project --extra dev --python /usr/local/bin/python3 && python -m hatchling build -t wheel -d /opt/diwan-wheel && uv sync --frozen --no-install-project --python /usr/local/bin/python3\n", "tests": ["tests/test_container_image.py::test_the_runtime_image_never_receives_the_dev_extra"], "why": "البناءُ في صورة التشغيل ثم حذفُ dev في الطبقة نفسِها يُبقي التصميمَ الذي نبّهت إليه ملاحظةُ Codex على #294"}
